WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.689
A scalar subquery has a strict result contract It
returns

00:00:05.715 --> 00:00:11.357
one column and at most one row One row gives the
scalar value

00:00:13.103 --> 00:00:19.070
Zero rows become NULL More than one row is an error
because the surrounding

00:00:19.096 --> 00:00:24.611
expression expected one value Understanding this
contract is more

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:27.282
important than remembering where the parentheses go
